AB AHL-E-BAIT KE LIYE ZINDAN-E-SHAM HAI<br>
<br>
Afsos berida hain nabi ki nawasiya<br>
Aur bekafan nawasa-e-khair-ul-anaam hai<br>
<br>
Rote hain phoot phoot ke pairo ke aable<br>
Abid ki natawani hai aur raahe sham hai<br>
<br>
Namehramo ka raah mein hai har taraf hujoom<br>
Beparda haye khwahar-e-shah-e-anaam hai<br>
<br>
Boli Sakina jabse mere baba uthgaye<br>
Kaisi ye subha hai phupi kaisi ye sham hai<br>
<br>
Jinno malak bhi aaye hain rone ko aye Sahaab<br>
Ye Majlis-e-Hussain alihis-salam hai
